<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subparagraph"><a href="#A4.SS1.SSS0.P0.SPx1" title="In D.1 Details on the implementation of baselines ‣ Appendix D Further Details on Evaluation of EAGLE ‣ Linear Transformers Implicitly DiscoverUnified Numerical Algorithms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Exact closed-form baseline (<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">np.linalg.lstsq</span>)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subparagraph"><a href="#A4.SS1.SSS0.P0.SPx2" title="In D.1 Details on the implementation of baselines ‣ Appendix D Further Details on Evaluation of EAGLE ‣ Linear Transformers Implicitly DiscoverUnified Numerical Algorithms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Gradient Descent.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subparagraph"><a href="#A4.SS1.SSS0.P0.SPx3" title="In D.1 Details on the implementation of baselines ‣ Appendix D Further Details on Evaluation of EAGLE ‣ Linear Transformers Implicitly DiscoverUnified Numerical Algorithms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Conjugate Gradient Method.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS2" title="In Appendix D Further Details on Evaluation of EAGLE ‣ Linear Transformers Implicitly DiscoverUnified Numerical Algorithms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2 </span>Accelerated EAGLE for distributed setting</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Further Details on Evaluation of EAGLE ‣ Linear Transformers Implicitly DiscoverUnified Numerical Algorithms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Ablations for EAGLE</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
