<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In D.3 Ablations for EAGLE ‣ Appendix D Further Details on Evaluation of EAGLE ‣ Linear Transformers Implicitly DiscoverUnified Numerical Algorithms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Larger systems.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In D.3 Ablations for EAGLE ‣ Appendix D Further Details on Evaluation of EAGLE ‣ Linear Transformers Implicitly DiscoverUnified Numerical Algorithms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Data noise.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In D.3 Ablations for EAGLE ‣ Appendix D Further Details on Evaluation of EAGLE ‣ Linear Transformers Implicitly DiscoverUnified Numerical Algorithms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Sensitivity to step sizes.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
