</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 8</span>: </span><span id="S6.F8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">In the stochastic data access regime—a variant of the compute-limited setting—EAGLE outperforms SGD in wall-clock time for sketch sizes <math id="S6.F8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\geq n/4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\geq n/4</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
